[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2972596708","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107514#issuecomment-2972596708","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107514","id":2972596708,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xLjnk","user":{"login":"daniel080400","id":26960237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTYwMjM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26960237?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel080400","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-14T10:24:13Z","updated_at":"2025-06-14T10:27:30Z","body":"I confirmed the issue is fixed by changing the cache mode from ```CACHE_MODE_IGNORE``` to ```CACHE_MODE_IGNORE_DEEP```, using the steps to reproduce mentioned in #107494 with an **blank project created after 4.4.1**. (Previously I tested with complex projects that are created prior to 4.4.1 and it's somehow not reproducible)\r\n\r\n>Open any scene containing child scenes with script. Change something. Don't save. Reload the scene via Scene -> Reload Saved Scene -> Save & Reload. All child scenes have 'lost' their script.\r\n\r\nWith the same project, the issue persists when changing it back to ```CACHE_MODE_IGNORE```, and fixed when changing it to ```CACHE_MODE_IGNORE_DEEP```.\r\n\r\nMarking this as ready for review, this change should have no side effects, we should merge it right away. May someone provide more testing results to let us confidently mark the issue as resolved.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2972596708/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2972786472","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107514#issuecomment-2972786472","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107514","id":2972786472,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xMR8o","user":{"login":"pmoosi","id":25228699,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjI4Njk5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25228699?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmoosi","html_url":"https://github.com/pmoosi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmoosi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmoosi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmoosi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmoosi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmoosi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmoosi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmoosi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmoosi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pmoosi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-14T14:14:04Z","updated_at":"2025-06-14T14:14:04Z","body":"Can confirm that it fixes the issue for me.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2972786472/reacti